{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"Tracker","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L51","fileName":"Tracker.swift"}},"abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and read it anywhere inside with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and queues","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" waits for the worker to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catch up; ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" does too, then ends the records.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the waits of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","type":"reference"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"track","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process exits. A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"code":"RecordStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"